  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> is the origin and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> are distinct tangents to the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the circumcentre of the triangle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> is",
